  "sourceTitle": "Cowboy Chocolate Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Cowboy Chocolate Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 17, 2009 - 12:27am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup shortening\n1 cup white sugar\n1 cup brown sugar\n2 eggs\n2 cups flour\n1 teaspoon baking powder\n1/2 cup chopped nuts\n1 teaspoon soda\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n2 cups oatmeal\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n1 (12 oz.) chocolate chips\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cream sugars and shortening. Add eggs. Beat until fluffy. Add flour, baking powder, soda, salt and oatmeal. Mix well. Add vanilla, chocolate chips and nuts. Stir well. Bake Pam or greased pan, 350 degrees, 12-15 minutes.",
